    "body": "This LGTM. I think you can check most of the boxes; specific bugs should not be necessary in other browsers that haven't implemented setHTMLUnsafe yet; WebKit is presumably interested based on @annevk filing https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9957; and this is too small to need an MDN issue.\r\n\r\nI'll give this 24 hours or so before merging to let us all finish the discussion in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9957 and let @annevk take a look if he wants, but we can merge any time (including while I'm asleep) since this seems pretty straightforward.",
